Subject: [PATCH] Patch glslang 16.0.1 and restore SPVRemapper

Namespacing for INTEGRITY.
Include condition changes for INTEGRITY.
C++ filesystem usage for QNX.
Restore a SPVRemapper ported to spirv.hpp11.
